ers (Content, Header, Footer, ButtonGroup) for composing a component's interior."},"245":{"id":"/docs/components/composition-1","page_id":"/docs/components/composition","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/composition#hybrid-styling","content":"Hybrid styling"},"246":{"id":"/docs/components/composition-2","page_id":"/docs/components/composition","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/composition#examples","content":"Examples"},"247":{"id":"/docs/components/composition-3","page_id":"/docs/components/composition","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/composition#default","content":"Default"},"248":{"id":"/docs/components/composition-4","page_id":"/docs/components/composition","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/composition#props","content":"Props"},"249":{"id":"/docs/components/composition-5","page_id":"/docs/components/composition","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/composition#content","content":"Content"},"250":{"id":"/docs/components/composition-6","page_id":"/docs/components/composition","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/composition#header","content":"Header"},"251":{"id":"/docs/components/composition-7","page_id":"/docs/components/composition","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/composition#footer","content":"Footer"},"252":{"id":"/docs/components/composition-8","page_id":"/docs/components/composition","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/composition#buttongroup","content":"ButtonGroup"},"253":{"id":"/docs/components/composition-9","page_id":"/docs/components/composition","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/composition","content":"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, .