m interchangeably."],[50,"Use `critical` only when the user truly cannot continue without resolving the issue. Overusing it reduces its impact."],[119,"Use `isDateUnavailable` for scattered disabled days; use `minValue` / `maxValue` for contiguous bounds."],[343,"Use `isDismissable` to allow closing via backdrop click."],[694,"Use `ModalTrigger` to wire a trigger element (typically a `Button`) to a `Modal`. Compose the interior:"],[1451,"Use `xType=\"time\"` when the X-axis values are Date objects:"],[1553,"Use Case"],[903,"Use clear, concise labels"],[212,"Use clear, concise labels that describe what selecting the option means"],[1549,"Use CSS \\`auto-fill\\` and \\`minmax()\\` for responsive column counts without media queries."],[1447,"Use for trends over time or along a continuous scale."],[1224,"Use icon-only items only when the icon's meaning is universally recognized. Always provide an `aria-label` on each icon-only `ToggleButton`:"],[776,"Use it with \\`\\<PopoverTrigger>\\`, which wraps both the popover content and an interactive trigger element (for example, a \\`Button\\`)."],[1237,"Use it with \\`TooltipTrigger\\`, which wraps both the tooltip content and a focusable element such as a \\`Button\\`. The tooltip appears on hover and focus."],[218,"Use logical ordering (alphabetical, frequency of use, or importance)"],[668,"Use the \\`compact\\` prop to render the metric value and description inline rather than stacked."],[235,"Use the \\`emphasis\\` prop to communicate status: \\`success\\`, \\`warning\\`, or \\`critical\\`. When omitted, the default teal fill is used."],[792,"Use the \\`status\\` prop to communicate intent: \\`default\\`, \\`success\\`, \\`warning\\`, or \\`critical\\`. Pair with \\`helperText\\` to provide additional context."],[667,"Use the \\`trend\\` prop to show a directional icon next to the description. Accepts \\`'positive'\\`, \\`'negative'\\`, or \\`'neutral'\\`."],[1443,"Use the `className` prop on the chart container to add or